                            <td class="p-3 font-bold text-gray-700">06:40 WIB</td>
                            <td class="p-3 font-bold text-gray-700">14:20 WIB</td>
                            <td class="p-3 text-gray-600">Pintu Kelas VII-A</td>
                            <td class="p-3 text-gray-500">Scan Barcode Statis</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-800">Jumat, 22 Agt 2026</td>
                            <td class="p-3"><span class="bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">HADIR</span></td>
                            <td class="p-3 font-bold text-gray-700">06:50 WIB</td>
                            <td class="p-3 font-bold text-gray-700">11:45 WIB</td>
                            <td class="p-3 text-gray-600">Pintu Kelas VII-A</td>
                            <td class="p-3 text-gray-500">Scan Barcode Statis</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
                            <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-800">Kamis, 21 Agt 2026</td>
                            <td class="p-3"><span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">TERLAMBAT</span></td>
                            <td class="p-3 font-bold text-red-600">07:22 WIB</td>
                            <td class="p-3 font-bold text-gray-700">14:10 WIB</td>
                            <td class="p-3 text-gray-600">Pintu Kelas VII-A</td>
                            <td class="p-3 text-gray-500">Scan Barcode Statis</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 3: ANALISIS BELAJAR -->
        <div id="section-analytics" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 border-b pb-3 mb-4">📈 Analisis Capaian & Evaluasi Belajar</h2>
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-blue-200">
                        <p class="text-xs text-blue-700 font-semibold">Rata-rata Ujian CBT</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mt-1">88.6 <span class="text-xs font-normal">(Predikat A)</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-emerald-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200">
                        <p class="text-xs text-emerald-700 font-semibold">Ketuntasan Tugas & PR</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-900 mt-1">95% <span class="text-xs font-normal">(19/20 Tugas)</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                        <p class="text-xs text-purple-700 font-semibold">Peringkat di Kelas</p>
                        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-purple-900 mt-1">Ke-3 <span class="text-xs font-normal">(dari 32 Siswa)</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">Detail Nilai per Mata Pelajaran:</h3>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">
                            <span>Matematika (86)</span>
                            <span class="text-emerald-700">Tuntas (Grade A)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5">
                            <div class="bg-blue-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 86%"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">
                            <span>Ilmu Pengetahuan Alam - IPA (92)</span>
                            <span class="text-emerald-700">Sangat Tuntas (Grade A)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5">
                            <div class="bg-emerald-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 92%"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">
                            <span>Bahasa Indonesia (90)</span>
                            <span class="text-emerald-700">Sangat Tuntas (Grade A)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5">
                            <div class="bg-sky-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 90%"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-1">
                            <span>Informatika & Komputer (95)</span>
                            <span class="text-emerald-700">Sangat Tuntas (Grade A)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-gray-200 rounded-full h-2.5">
                            <div class="bg-purple-600 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="width: 95%"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 text-xs space-y-1 text-amber-900">
                    <p class="font-bold">💡 Catatan Evaluasi Wali Kelas & Rekomendasi Belajar AI:</p>
                    <p class="leading-relaxed">"Ananda memiliki logika sains dan informatika yang sangat unggul. Pertahankan latihan soal terstruktur untuk memaksimalkan capaian nilai 100 pada ujian akhir."</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 4: E-FILE SISWA -->
        <div id="section-efiles" class="hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 border-b pb-3 mb-4">📁 Arsip Dokumen & E-File Digital Siswa</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                    <div class="p-4 border rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm">📑 Rapor Digital Semester Ganjil</p>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Format PDF • 2.4 MB • Resmi</p>
